  "notes": "メモ (from English 'memo/memorandum') refers to short notes or reminders.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- メモを{取|と}る: to take notes\n- メモする: to make a note, to jot down\n- メモを{残|のこ}す: to leave a note\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- メモ{帳|ちょう}: memo pad, notepad\n- メモ{用紙|ようし}: memo paper\n- {付箋|ふせん}メモ: sticky note\n- {伝言|でんごん}メモ: message memo\n\nRELATED:\n- ノート: notebook (for longer notes)\n- {覚|おぼ}え{書|が}き: memorandum (more formal)",
